              "tier": "supreme+",
              "targeting": "Self",
              "description": "While the Frost Shield is active, Cryonaia instantly freezes and defeats enemies within the domain of Eternal Winter if their current HP is below 300% of her ATK and their HP percentage is lower than 15%."
